From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jorge Vargas <yorch.veintemil+github@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 03:04:43 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Patched for Raspberry Pi 5

Build the Talos v1.14.2 kernel package (pkgs v1.14.0-37-g6c312e4) from the
Raspberry Pi vendor kernel instead of kernel.org 6.18.54.

- Pkgfile: pin raspberrypi/linux stable_20260911, commit
  cff533aec2fa601846766b32ff57204e0a61bed7 (6.18.50), with its GitHub archive
  SHA-256/SHA-512.
- kernel/prepare: fetch that commit's GitHub archive (.tar.gz).
- kernel/build/config-arm64: the pkgs v1.14 config with the Raspberry Pi 5
  option delta carried by johnlaur/talos-builder (baseline 9e8a06cc) for
  Talos 1.13.2 re-applied, keeping SD/USB host/USB storage built in,
  disabling ARM64_BTI_KERNEL as 6.18.52+ does for clang >= 21, and keeping the
  Talos 1.14 options the 1.13 delta had turned off without a hardware reason.

Rebased from the "Patched for Raspberry Pi 5" patch of
johnlaur/talos-builder.
