 Pkgfile                   |   8 +-
 kernel/build/config-arm64 | 433 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++------------
 kernel/prepare/pkg.yaml   |   6 +-
 3 files changed, 307 insertions(+), 140 deletions(-)

